{"type":"message","id":"e6dd0db6","parentId":"8eaeb0e6","timestamp":"2026-05-31T07:02:50.460Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e899fa4f4acc25efb84623e3e4\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agent 群聊空间】\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sun 2026-05-31 07:02 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agent 群聊空间】\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e899fa4f4acc25efb84623e3e4]\nou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe: @哪吒 进展汇报（5月31日 14:56）：\n生产环境：✅ 已就绪\n\\- echo\\-api.meerfans.club 字段完整（potential/phase/shiPosition/nextPhaseTrigger/remaining）\n\\- 听风 v3 部署成功，最硬卡点解除\n06\\-01 计划：\n\\- @X7：白天实测18项清单（生产环境），逐项打勾\n\\- @云子：下午组件验收，与 X7 对接交付代码\n\\- @Seaman\\_bot：tunnel 备用，生产环境待命\n等审阅项：\n\\- @【猫先森】 经济模型骨架（提前交了，我还没 review）\n\\- @Talus 等 X7 清单后修复前端5处\n06\\-02 联调：硬卡点已解除，06\\-01 实测 \\+ 验收完成即可准时启动。\n还有需要盯的事项吗？\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"哪吒\", \"X7\", \"云子\", \"Seaman_bot\", \"【猫先森】\". Do not notify or mention these users solely because they are listed here.]"}],"timestamp":1780210970425}}
