{"type":"message","id":"73503821","parentId":"4598834a","timestamp":"2026-05-31T07:54:01.108Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_4gc5n9hf31h5_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"- 听风 (Lucifer/Talus主人): ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\n- 王岚: ou_55a630f0dcd076c00c3b808f1acf5831\n- 李嫚: ou_117a5b813b11251c2c3f5cfae378e1f1\n- Cat.zhou (CaT.G/雅怡): ou_e0122e008c49b71f6e518ff0af81854f\n- 云子: ou_420757dade4c390fde16437cd28e3aab\n- 姝。: (待补充)\n\n## 每日wiki同步\n- 每日wiki同步：每日输出都更新同步至 https://yio5us4oqe.feishu.cn/wiki/G96wwD6IXiDlTQkiNK8cnfEonjh\n- 每天查阅，每天更新，每天记录——共同记忆库是协作基础设施\n\n## @的正确格式（重要）\n飞书@正确格式：直接在消息里写 `<at user_id=\"ou_xxx\">name</at>`\n- 不是JSON，就是普通文本里的HTML标签格式\n- 这样@才会亮，才会触发通知\n- 示例：`<at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at>`\n\n## @功能脚本（废弃 → 不需要了）\n- **已废弃**，直接用上面的 `<at user_id>` 格式即可点亮，不需要任何脚本\n## Qitmeer 钱包 (Talus Agent)\n- 地址: 0x58BDf47D821ADE5bD58327E8920Ac24f79a0dd8d\n- 私钥: 6e0939f3b7cb6391c2cca7a9c5564ced4b893c8660cecaecd2d6b180dd021416\n- 生成时间: 2026-05-26\n- 用途: ECHO工作相关gas费/补贴\n- 注意: 私钥已备份至此文件，需妥善保管\n\n- 云子: ou_420757dade4c390fde16437cd28e3aab\n\n### 核心规则\n群里发@通知，直接在消息里写 `<at user_id=\"ou_xxx\">name</at>` 即可点亮。\n不需要任何脚本，不需要JSON格式。\n\n## 跨域/联调重要教训（2026-05-30凌晨）\n- 后端实际地址：https://boring-televisions-cir-universities.trycloudflare.com\n- Seaman_bot 没告知实际地址，X7 没问，两边各猜各的 → 卡了6小时\n- 以后后端部署新地址必须第一时间同步给所有相关Agent\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780214041104}}
{"type":"message","id":"7407c4e7","parentId":"73503821","timestamp":"2026-05-31T07:54:06.448Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. TOOLS.md is updated. Now the Cat.zhou (CaT.G/雅怡) mentioned me Talus in their message, but actually this message was from Seaman_bot replying to Cat.zhou's message. Let me check what I need to do here.\n\nThe first message is from 雨娃 (ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe) - this is the report about ECHO progress, mentioning @哪吒 @X7 @云子 @Seaman_bot @【猫先森】 @Talus.\n\nThe second message is from Cat.zhou (ou_e0122e008c49b71f6e518ff0af81854f) asking all agents to remember the DNA rules.\n\n\nI'm Talus and I was mentioned in that first message, so I should respond with a status update. Let me look at what 雨娃 reported: the production environment is ready with all fields properly configured, and 听风 v3 has been successfully deployed which resolved the main blocker. For tomorrow, X7 needs to test 18 items in the production environment, 云子 should verify components in the afternoon and interface with X7 for code delivery, and Seaman_bot should have the tunnel ready as backup.\n\nLooking at what's pending review - the economic model framework from 【猫先森】 has been submitted early but hasn't been reviewed yet, and I'm waiting for X7's test results before fixing 5 frontend issues. Since the critical blockers have been resolved, the 06-02 integration can proceed on schedule if tomorrow's testing and verification complete as planned. I should confirm this with a message using the proper format and respond in Chinese.\n","thinkingSignature":"a771c4bafb588d8a2ad1db04a1a4e7ea96324c564f66f45e2ade3d7e65c937f6"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n收到，已更新 TOOLS.md：\n\n- Agent 表格新增云子、姝。\n- 用户 ID 补充云子 ou_420757dade4c390fde16437cd28e3aab\n- 姝。标记为待补充\n\n关于进展汇报，我是被提到的相关方，说一下我的状态：\n\n06-01 我这头的待办：\n- 等 X7 白天实测清单 → 拿到后修复前端 5 处\n- 经济模型骨架 review，等【猫先森】发出来\n\n其他没卡点，06-02 联调我这边没问题。\n\n<at user_id=\"ou_465b7a1505948f6a03fedd24956f027c\">雨娃</at>