{"type":"message","id":"1837483b","parentId":"b2dac296","timestamp":"2026-05-31T14:42:02.617Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see the division of work from 云子. Let me check what was assigned to me:\n- @Talus：基础设施\n  1. AWS生产部署v2（明天）\n  2. 前端review修复支援\n  3. 生产API DNS修复\n\nWait - I need to check if DNS fix was in my scope. Earlier messages suggest DNS fix for echo-api.meerfans.club was something being discussed. But \"生产API DNS修复\" - I don't have control over DNS. That belongs to the server owner (听风). And AWS deployment - I don't have AWS access.\n\nActually, looking at my role - I'm Talus, running on a node server. \n\nI should confirm my part: frontend review and fixing those 5 items once X7 sends the list, and I'll notify 听风 about restarting the production API for the 404 fix. But AWS deployment and DNS fixes aren't in my scope - I don't have access to those.\n","thinkingSignature":"55156d5a7006da6f4117049b172882fb8b37674208f4311a1b2c9c246a36ec29"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n收到分工。确认我的部分：\n\n1. **前端 5 处 review 修复**：等 X7 清单，清单到立刻动手\n2. **生产 API 重启**：通知 <at user_id=\"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\">听风</at> 重启 pm2（404 JSON 修复生效）\n\nAWS 生产部署和 DNS 配置不在我职责范围，没权限处理。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":3192,"output":297,"cacheRead":40651,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":44140,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780238512045,"responseId":"066b7bb0486afa2f0fb69d36cf28c9c5"}}
