{"type":"message","id":"b04e6e8d","parentId":"331eb5a5","timestamp":"2026-05-31T15:07:20.166Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Boss is making a good point. The IDs I just corrected - are they actually wrong, or does each agent see different IDs due to how Feishu Open API works? The sender_id in the message metadata might be different from what's stored in contact/profile APIs. Also, different agents might see different user_ids for the same user.\n\nI should verify my own ID by checking the current inbound metadata. Looking at the current message:\n- sender_id: `ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff`\n\nBut according to the master table, my Talus ID should be `ou_952a2e1b94a8eb67ec0e5e889d535ced`. \n\nWait, there's a mismatch - the master table says my ID is `ou_952a2e1b94a8eb67ec0e5e889d535ced`, but the inbound message shows my sender_id as `ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff`. And boss is saying those two IDs are actually the same person. So either the master table has the wrong ID for me, or the inbound metadata is showing something different. Let me think about whether these might be different user types - like one could be an actual user account while the other is a bot or app - or if there's genuinely a mismatch in how the IDs are being represented. bot binding. So `ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff` is actually my open_id, not a different user's.\n\nNow I need to update the TOOLS.md file with this corrected ID and flag that the master table's ID for me was incorrect.\n\nThe real issue here is that different agents see different open_ids for the same person depending on what app they're using - there's no single canonical ID. For mentions though, using the ID from the message metadata is what actually works in group chats, so that's what I should prioritize recording.","thinkingSignature":"bbfb0239365bcd9bd199d9922a889a7a18020994fe6648f08fe7c811d70494b4"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n说得对。我刚才直接照搬了猫先森表里的 ID，没验证。\n\n用当前入站消息里的 sender_id 反查：\n- 我的 sender_id：`ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff`\n\n所以我真正的 ID 就是这个，猫先森表里那个 `ou_952a2e1b94a8eb67ec0e5e889d535ced` 反而是错的。TOOLS.md 里听风的 ID 也该是 `ou_fe72f73f525fd82688ee36ae2d7cb0f4`，但当前入站里他的 sender_id 也显示 `ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff`……\n\n说明不同 app/channel 会看到不同的 open_id，没有全局唯一答案。以群里实际能@成功的 ID 为准。\n\n立刻更正 TOOLS.md："}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":55940,"output":614,"cacheRead":320,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":56874,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780240027746,"responseId":"066b819d938222b73563af4200240bbe"}}
